soever]] [[has|have]] [[ever]] [[come]] [[for]] [[her]].`,`vn`:`\u00d4ng t\u1eebng h\u1ee9a k\u1ec3 ch\u00e1u nghe chuy\u1ec7n l\u00e1 th\u01b0 \u0111i m\u1ea5t hai m\u01b0\u01a1i n\u0103m m\u1edbi t\u1edbi n\u01a1i. L\u00e1 th\u01b0 \u1ea5y l\u00e0 c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng. \u00d4ng n\u1ee3 m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n c\u0169 \u1edf mi\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ed3i m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi xin l\u1ed7i, v\u00e0 n\u0103m n\u00e0o \u00f4ng c\u0169ng vi\u1ebft l\u1ea1i n\u00f3, ch\u1ec9 v\u00ec ch\u01b0a l\u1ea7n n\u00e0o n\u00f3 ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o. Trong l\u00fac n\u1eb1m \u1ed1m, cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00f4ng c\u0169ng nh\u1edd ng\u01b0\u1eddi g\u1eedi n\u00f3 \u0111i, b\u1ea5t k\u1ec3 n\u00f3 c\u00f2n bao nhi\u00eau ch\u1ed7 d\u1edf. Th\u01b0 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00f4m th\u1ee9 B\u1ea3y, d\u00f9 l\u00e0 b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t ch\u1eef tr\u1ebb con: m\u1eaft \u00f4ng \u1ea5y k\u00e9m, n\u00ean b\u00e9 Suong, con g\u00e1i c\u1ee7a con g\u00e1i \u00f4ng \u1ea5y, vi\u1ebft thay \u00f4ng. C\u00f4 b\u00e9 ch\u00edn tu\u1ed5i, v\u00e0 ch\u01b0a t\u1eebng c\u00f3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00e1 th\u01b0 n\u00e0o g\u1eedi cho ri\u00eang m\u00ecnh.`},{`en`:`[[Hence]] [[this]] [[package]]. ([[Yes]], [[I]] [[am|be]] [[two]] [[hundred]] [[years|year]] [[old]].) [[It]] [[holds|hold]] [[my]] [[pen]] [[and]] [[her]] [[address]]. [[The]] [[former]] [[has|have]] [[been|be]] [[used]] [[exclusively]] [[for]] [[letters|letter]], [[never]] [[for]] [[bills|bill]]; [[the]] [[latter]] [[is|be]] [[waiting|wait]]. [[I]] [[give]] [[you]] [[both]] [[under]] an [[arrangement]] [[whereby]] [[you]] [[write]] [[each]] [[letter]] [[once]] [[and]] [[post]] [[it]] [[the]] [[same]] [[day]]. [[That]] [[is|be]] [[my]] [[sole]] [[condition]], [[and]] [[you]] [[will]] [[thereby]] [[spare]] Suong [[my]] [[twenty]] [[years|year]]. [[My]] \`[[mere]] [[cold]]\` [[taught|teach]] [[me]] [[what]] [[forty]] [[years|year]] [[of]] [[post]] [[had|have]] [[not]]: [[a]] [[letter]] [[exists|exist]] [[for]] [[the]] [[sake]] [[of]] [[i